  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ecosystem mapping Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to update the entrepreneurial ecosystem map for Mali, specifically for the regions Bamako, Sikasso, S&#xE9;gou and Mopti. The current ecosystem map is not up to date, and in need for renewal. The ecosystem map will support the implementation of the Orange Corners and Orange Corners Innovation Fund programmes in Mali. In addition, the map will inform the development and implementation of other ecosystem projects &#x2013; based on identified leverage points and key stakeholders. The Youth Employment &amp; Entrepreneurship Team (YEET) and the Netherlands embassy in Bamako, Mali, will work together with Niang Holding in doing the ecosystem mapping, as the current (security) situation doesn&#x2019;t allow the YEET team to complete the full mapping by itself.</narrative>
  </description>
